{"path":"eval/cases/cigster-99/sources/pr.json","ref":"993e40a2b984d0c2f4979f8367190719f4c7b97e","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/99\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 99,"},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"Multi-browser living-room E2E + rename visual→e2e (#98)\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\\n## Summary\\n\\nImplements [#98](https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/issues/98): multi-context living-room E2E + rename visual→e2e.\\n\\nAlso: platform snapshot dirs (`linux/` committed; `darwin/`/`win32/` gitignored) and `pnpm test:e2e:ui`.\\n\\n## UI Mode note\\n\\n`pnpm test:e2e:ui` sets `E2E_UI=1` and **skips webServer** so the test list is instant (UI Mode otherwise hangs on “Loading…” during `convex init` with blank output). Start the app first:\\n\\n```bash\\npnpm convex\\npnpm dev\\npnpm test:e2e:ui\\n```\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- [x] Living-room 10× flake check\\n- [x] Docker landing goldens after `snapshots/linux/` move\\n- [x] `--list` still reports 88 tests after visual/live project split\\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-62ee1795-c7a4-4e0b-8d2c-4881f597144f?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Web\\\" width=\\\"114\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-62ee1795-c7a4-4e0b-8d2c-4881f597144f&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Open in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"131\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\\n\\n\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-08-10T10:13:38Z\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":10,"text":"  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"2e1cf47b857d413f7e4f5f5f71355587c78da30a\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":11,"text":"  \"base\": {"},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":12,"text":"    \"ref\": \"main\","},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac707cd3724d0b","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":13,"text":"    \"sha\": \"c8a6ae57e21e1e18d82679c9d359b2f72ef902ad\""},{"sha":"d3c79e318649f8245dcc97e20aac